-- Free-course catalog for the skill-gap feature.
--
-- Every skill_slug below is validated at generation time against profile-service's
-- V2__seed_skills.sql taxonomy. That check matters because a typo'd slug fails
-- SILENTLY at runtime: the gap is still reported, it just recommends nothing, with
-- no error anywhere to notice.
--
-- Curated toward genuinely free or audit-able resources (official docs, freeCodeCamp,
-- vendor learning portals). Not exhaustive by design -- a skill with no row here
-- simply gets no recommendation, which beats inventing a plausible-looking dead link.

